  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Church for development, justice and peace in Africa:  Support for SECAM good governance project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to support and further strengthen the capacity building of the Catholic Church in Africa and in its advocacy role so as to enable her decision makers to respond swiftly and appropriately to political and socio-economic challenges in matters of democratisation, good governance, development, justice and peace in Africa and to support the dissemination and implementation of the Post-Synodal Apostolic Exhortation:  Africae Munus within Regional and National Episcopal Conferences.</narrative>
  </description>
